LogiHide modifications, 2026-11-06, by logimox
-------------------------------------------
LogiHide is an independent modified fork of holzcloud/holzBar.
Base commit: 3129512c6f22cf572fadab7cd547dab3aeb3fd2e.
DuoBar status UI and services are adapted from Mikeli7666/DuoBar,
commit fc348a53a25855b7c9433583b4beae4eb256feeb (Copyright (c) 2026 Mike Li).
DuoBar's MIT license is retained in Vendor/DuoStatusKit/LICENSE and in
holzBar/Resources/Acknowledgements/DuoBar.txt.
Changes combine system status with holzBar's visible control item, add
hiding/layout actions, Swedish status labels and distinct app identity/storage.
The combined work is distributed under GNU GPL v3.0; see LICENSE.
This fork is not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream authors.
The macOS 27 indicator fix supplies a live native NSButton image while
assessment-mode concealment is active and restores the hosted view on reveal.

LogiHide 0.1.1 modifications, 2026-11-06
--------------------------------------
Added a background app for assessment-mode assertions, private parent/child
pipe messages, lifecycle recovery, explicit show/hide controls and their tests.
The helper's assertion implementation retains the holzBar/Barometer/Thaw credits.
Documented and verified the macOS 27 requirement to run the menu app from
/Applications, and added an installation script that preserves the prior app.
